The results presented here were achieved precisely because of the changes described above: graph-based feature filtering reduced the number of false entries caused by indicator spikes, while small-world connections in the cell topology accelerated adaptation to changes in the market regime. The combination of the Network Health and Graph Health metrics allows you to monitor when the system is in a stable state and when it is at risk of herding.
